 "remarks": "Inviting four-bedroom Tudor enjoys a beautiful, private backyard elevated by bluestone patio and lush, mature plantings on a desirable road near schools, shops and trains. Spacious interior blends exquisite original details with modern amenities including wood floors, four updated full baths and new windows. Welcoming front porch leads into living room with wood stove; dining room, chef&apos;s kitchen, with Bertazzoni range, patio access; family room, full bath and wonderful sunroom/office with sliders to patio. Primary suite with dressing room and fabulous bath with tub, shower and balcony; bedroom with loft, bedroom and full hall bath comprise second floor. Lower level provides bedroom suite with own entrance, ideal for au-pair/in-laws, laundry/mudroom and attached garage. *Also available for rent*",
